        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition to the current standard-of-care treatments to address the diseases we are targeting in therapeutic development programs, numerous commercial and academic preclinical studies and clinical trials are being undertaken by a large number of parties to assess novel technologies and product candidates.",
        "start_character": 36042,
        "end_character": 36350
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001736730-26-000016",
