        "accession_number": "0001736730-26-000016",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-05",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "These platform technologies, and our intellectual property portfolio related thereto, relate broadly to our existing product candidates and those we may develop in the future.",
        "start_character": 45277,
        "end_character": 45452
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001736730-26-000016",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001736730-26-000016-45f6b3d202d085b5",
        "accession_number": "0001736730-26-000016",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-05",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Under the terms of the GSK Agreement, we have granted GSK an exclusive, worldwide license under certain patents and know-how to research, develop, manufacture, and commercialize certain compounds and products directed to the Collaboration Targets.",
