        "accession_number": "0001736730-26-000016",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-05",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We, along with our contract manufacturers (“CMOs”), contract research organizations CROs, and third-party vendors, will be required to satisfy these requirements in each of the countries in which we wish to conduct studies or seek approval of our product candidates.",
